{"id": "EUVD-2026-87314", "enisaUuid": "734337bb-ef58-359e-b685-a333417574a4", "description": "GNU libextractor before 1.16 loads plugins from an untrusted search path specified by the LIBEXTRACTOR_PREFIX environment variable without proper privilege checks. A local attacker can exploit this by setting LIBEXTRACTOR_PREFIX to a directory containing a malicious plugin that executes arbitrary code with elevated privileges when loaded by a setuid or setgid program.", "datePublished": "2026-09-25T19:38:28", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-30T00:05:50", "baseScore": 7.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:L/AT:P/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/Haitam-lazaar/libextractor-privesc", "https://git.gnunet.org/gnunet/libextractor/commit/6edfa653c048800e24a17f7e8cc2bb42659b8d01.html", "https://ftp.gnu.org/gnu/libextractor/", "https://www.gnu.org/software/libextractor/", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/gnu-libextractor-before-1.16-privilege-escalation-via-libextractor-prefix"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-100310", "GHSA-rxpm-xfjv-mq65"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.14, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "1a35c190-74f1-3664-ba7a-c30aaee3590e", "product": {"name": "libextractor", "vendor": {"name": "GNU"}}, "product_version": "0 <1.16"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "5074a412-1d52-3dab-8396-1dee5705f174", "vendor": {"name": "GNU"}}], "isExploited": false}